    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Pactbound Zealots",
    "summary": "When mustering your army, each HERETIC ASTARTES unit you include, except an EPIC HERO or a unit that already has one of these keywords, must be given one of KHORNE, TZEENTCH, NURGLE, SLAANESH or CHAOS UNDIVIDED, recorded on your Army Roster.\n\nAfter using Dark Pacts, a marked unit that gains a weapon ability and passes the Leadership test gets its mark benefit for the rest of that phase.\n[LETHAL HITS] • A natural 5+ to hit is critical in melee for KHORNE and at range for TZEENTCH.\n[SUSTAINED HITS 1] • A natural 5+ to hit is critical at range for NURGLE and in melee for SLAANESH.\nCHAOS UNDIVIDED • Either weapon ability allows the unit’s models to reroll hit rolls of 1.",
